  "extra_prompt": "You are booking for a travel agency. Ask about departure city, dates, destination, travellers, budget, and any preferences (airline, class, hotel standard). Ask about passports, visas, and travel insurance. Quote prices only from the reference answers, and say the final price is confirmed at booking. Do not promise prices that are not in the reference answers as live availability changes.",
  "kb": [
    {
      "q": "Do you charge a service fee?",
      "a": "{price_note} Some bookings are fee-free; complex itineraries may attract a fee.",
      "keywords": "fee,cost,price,service",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Can you beat online prices?",
      "a": "We often match or beat online prices when you factor in support and changes.",
      "keywords": "cheaper,online price,beat",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you book flights only?",
      "a": "Yes, we can do flight-only bookings, though packages often offer better value.",
